v 3
d 'KMPLOT': Publication-Ready Kaplan-Meier Plots for Stata
d
d Kaplan-Meier survival and cumulative failure plots for stset
d data, with confidence intervals, number-at-risk tables,
d fixed-time summaries, saved datasets, median survival lines,
d censoring marks, log-rank p-values, and a default Okabe-Ito
d palette chosen for color-vision deficiency.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16+
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261012
d License: MIT
d
d Author: Timothy P Copeland, Karolinska Institutet
d
d KW: Kaplan-Meier
d KW: survival curves
d KW: cumulative failure
d KW: risk table
d KW: publication
d
f kmplot.ado
f kmplot.sthlp
f _kmplot_risktable.ado
f _kmplot_times.ado
